    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Till the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murim Survival, inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Diablo</i>, is a roguelite RPG that </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >emphasizes gear farming and character progression. In a martial world on </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the brink of collapse, you must fight relentless monsters and survive against all odds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure waves of enemies for 15 to 20 minutes, then face a powerful final foe </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in a fierce battle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the Master of Murim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in battle, don\u2019t be discouraged. Venture into new areas to obtain various </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >items and martial arts techniques, and grow stronger by interacting with NPCs at your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hideout. Some of them may even become your allies. Additionally, you can improve your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > martial arts proficiency through repeated use. With each run, you\u2019ll grow stronger and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >push further in your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the Secrets of a Dying World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Murim, established by the legendary master Mujin, flourished </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for 500 years before beginning its descent into ruin. All Righteous Sects have been </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wiped out, and the land is now overrun by monsters and bandits. To make matters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >worse, a contagious disease called Madness has spread, plunging the Murim into chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turbulent world, the protagonist, Soun, embarks on a perilous journey to find </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cure for his Madness. Along the way, he will face countless trials, uncover hidden </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >truths, and grow into a true hero. The fate of the Murim lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, casual runs lasting 15\u201320 minutes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pixel-art martial world brought to life with rich detail</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bosses, each with unique mechanics and attack patterns</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse build possibilities, combining active &amp; passive skills, gear, and traits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial Arts Mastery\u2014train your skills to grow stronger</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire gear that remains permanent after obtaining.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs and complete quests to enhance your hero</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions by fulfilling special quests</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension Difficulty, unlocked after clearing normal difficulty, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for those seeking the ultimate challenge</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Till the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murim Survival, inspired by <i>Vampire Survivors</i> and <i>Diablo</i>, is a roguelite RPG that </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >emphasizes gear farming and character progression. In a martial world on </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the brink of collapse, you must fight relentless monsters and survive against all odds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure waves of enemies for 15 to 20 minutes, then face a powerful final foe </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in a fierce battle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become the Master of Murim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in battle, don\u2019t be discouraged. Venture into new areas to obtain various </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >items and martial arts techniques, and grow stronger by interacting with NPCs at your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > hideout. Some of them may even become your allies. Additionally, you can improve your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > martial arts proficiency through repeated use. With each run, you\u2019ll grow stronger and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >push further in your next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unravel the Secrets of a Dying World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Murim, established by the legendary master Mujin, flourished </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for 500 years before beginning its descent into ruin. All Righteous Sects have been </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wiped out, and the land is now overrun by monsters and bandits. To make matters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >worse, a contagious disease called Madness has spread, plunging the Murim into chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turbulent world, the protagonist, Soun, embarks on a perilous journey to find </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a cure for his Madness. Along the way, he will face countless trials, uncover hidden </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >truths, and grow into a true hero. The fate of the Murim lies in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, casual runs lasting 15\u201320 minutes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pixel-art martial world brought to life with rich detail</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging bosses, each with unique mechanics and attack patterns</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse build possibilities, combining active &amp; passive skills, gear, and traits</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial Arts Mastery\u2014train your skills to grow stronger</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire gear that remains permanent after obtaining.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with NPCs and complete quests to enhance your hero</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit companions by fulfilling special quests</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascension Difficulty, unlocked after clearing normal difficulty, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for those seeking the ultimate challenge</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Murim Survival is a survival roguelite where you battle relentless enemies within a time limit. Explore a world on the brink of collapse, master martial arts, collect powerful equipment, and unlock unique traits to become a true hero of the Murim. The fate of this world is in your hands.",
